Description: avutil/stereo3d: represent tiled and remaining quincunx layouts
 .
 H.264 D.2.26 permits tiled packing and quincunx sampling of rows,
 columns and top/bottom layouts. Give each a named side-data value,
 following the existing side-by-side quincunx representation.
 .
 Extend the name conversion test through all new values. It passes
 with this implementation and fails with the previous name table.
 .
 Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, https://code.ffmpeg.org/danielcamposramos/FFmpeg/commit/61cfefab0ad6d1a263870167f182b0242d8beea5
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-09
Refreshed for FFmpeg 9.1 (deb-multimedia 10:9.1-dmo1), 2026-11-26: libavutil's minor version is raised from FFmpeg 9.1's 61.19 to 61.20, the step this addition took on 9.0.2.

